msgid ""
"KDE Partition Manager is a utility program to help you manage the disk "
"devices, partitions and file systems on your computer. It allows you to "
"easily create, copy, move, delete, resize without losing data, backup and "
"restore partitions."
msgstr ""
"El xestor de particiones KDE ye una utilidá p'ayudar a xestionar los preseos "
"de discu, particiones y sistemes de ficheros nel to ordenador. Permítete "
"crear , copiar, mover, desaniciar, redimensionar ensin perder datos, "
"respaldar y reaturar particiones cenciellamente"

